<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bank of East Asia lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bank of East Asia lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it lowered its near-term recommendation on Bank of East Asia Ltd to neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The long-term rating remains neutral.</p>
<p>-- The bank's U.S.-traded American Depositary Receipts were unchanged in early Bulletin Board trade at 4.52.</p>
</text>
